    "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input." : {
      "comment" : "Panel: text of the OLED notice alert",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El contingut brillant que es queda molt de temps al mateix lloc, com la barra de menús, pot desgastar els panells OLED de manera desigual. L’Overbright manté la brillantor extra més baixa a les pantalles OLED i la posa en pausa després de 5 minuts sense activitat."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jasný obsah, který zůstává dlouho na jednom místě, například řádek nabídek, může panely OLED opotřebovávat nerovnoměrně. Overbright proto na monitorech OLED drží extra jas nižší a po 5 minutách bez vstupu ho pozastaví."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lyst indhold, der står samme sted i lang tid, f.eks. menulinjen, kan slide OLED-paneler ujævnt. Overbright holder ekstra lysstyrke lavere på OLED-skærme og sætter den på pause efter 5 minutter uden aktivitet."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Helle Inhalte, die lange an derselben Stelle bleiben, etwa die Menüleiste, können OLED-Panels ungleichmäßig altern lassen. Overbright hält die Zusatzhelligkeit auf OLED-Displays niedriger und pausiert sie nach 5 Minuten ohne Eingabe."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El contenido brillante que permanece mucho tiempo en el mismo lugar, como la barra de menús, puede desgastar los paneles OLED de forma desigual. Overbright mantiene más bajo el brillo extra en las pantallas OLED y lo pausa tras 5 minutos sin actividad."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les contenus lumineux qui restent longtemps au même endroit, comme la barre des menus, peuvent user les dalles OLED de manière inégale. Overbright limite la luminosité supplémentaire sur les écrans OLED et la met en pause après 5 minutes sans activité."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Svijetli sadržaj koji dugo ostaje na istom mjestu, poput trake s izbornicima, može neravnomjerno trošiti OLED panele. Overbright na OLED zaslonima drži dodatnu svjetlinu nižom i pauzira je nakon 5 minuta bez unosa."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I contenuti luminosi che restano a lungo nello stesso punto, come la barra dei menu, possono usurare i pannelli OLED in modo non uniforme. Overbright mantiene più bassa la luminosità extra sugli schermi OLED e la mette in pausa dopo 5 minuti di inattività."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lyst innhold som blir stående på samme sted lenge, som menylinjen, kan slite OLED-paneler ujevnt. Overbright holder ekstra lysstyrke lavere på OLED-skjermer og setter den på pause etter 5 minutter uten aktivitet."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heldere inhoud die lang op één plek blijft, zoals de menubalk, kan OLED-panelen ongelijkmatig laten slijten. Overbright houdt extra helderheid lager op OLED-beeldschermen en pauzeert die na 5 minuten zonder invoer."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jasne elementy, które długo pozostają w jednym miejscu, np. pasek menu, mogą nierównomiernie zużywać panele OLED. Overbright utrzymuje niższą dodatkową jasność na wyświetlaczach OLED i wstrzymuje ją po 5 minutach bezczynności."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conteúdos claros que ficam muito tempo no mesmo lugar, como a barra de menus, podem desgastar os painéis OLED de forma desigual. O Overbright mantém o brilho extra mais baixo em telas OLED e o pausa após 5 minutos sem atividade."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conteúdos brilhantes que ficam muito tempo no mesmo sítio, como a barra de menus, podem desgastar os painéis OLED de forma irregular. O Overbright mantém o brilho extra mais baixo nos monitores OLED e coloca‑o em pausa após 5 minutos sem atividade."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conținutul luminos care rămâne mult timp în același loc, precum bara de meniu, poate uza neuniform panourile OLED. Pe afișajele OLED, Overbright menține luminozitatea suplimentară mai redusă și o pune pe pauză după 5 minute fără activitate."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Яркие элементы, которые долго остаются на одном месте (например, строка меню), могут неравномерно изнашивать OLED-панели. На OLED-дисплеях Overbright ограничивает дополнительную яркость и приостанавливает её после 5 минут без ввода."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jasný obsah, ktorý zostáva dlho na jednom mieste, napríklad lišta, môže panely OLED opotrebúvať nerovnomerne. Overbright preto na displejoch OLED drží extra jas nižší a po 5 minútach bez vstupu ho pozastaví."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Svetla vsebina, ki dolgo ostane na istem mestu, na primer menijska vrstica, lahko neenakomerno obrablja zaslone OLED. Overbright zato na zaslonih OLED ohranja dodatno svetlost nižjo in jo po 5 minutah brez vnosa začasno ustavi."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ljust innehåll som stannar på samma plats länge, som menyraden, kan slita ojämnt på OLED-paneler. Overbright håller den extra ljusstyrkan lägre på OLED-skärmar och pausar den efter 5 minuter utan aktivitet."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Яскраві елементи, які довго залишаються на одному місці (наприклад, смуга меню), можуть нерівномірно зношувати OLED-панелі. На OLED-дисплеях Overbright обмежує додаткову яскравість і призупиняє її після 5 хвилин без введення."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bright content that stays in one place for a long time, like the menu bar, can wear OLED panels unevenly. Overbright keeps extra brightness lower on OLED displays and pauses it after 5 minutes without input."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay." : {
      "comment" : "Panel ▸ Display card: help tag of the Compatibility mode caption",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Augmenta la brillantor amb una capa superposada. El punter no es fa més brillant i les gravacions de pantalla poden mostrar la capa."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zjasňuje pomocí překryvné vrstvy. Ukazatel se nezjasní a na záznamech obrazovky může být překryvná vrstva vidět."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gør skærmen lysere med en overlejring. Markøren bliver ikke lysere, og skærmoptagelser kan vise overlejringen."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hellt über eine Überlagerung auf. Der Zeiger wird nicht aufgehellt, und Bildschirmaufnahmen können die Überlagerung zeigen."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aumenta el brillo mediante una superposición. El puntero no gana brillo y las grabaciones de pantalla pueden mostrar la superposición."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Éclaircit au moyen d’une superposition. Le pointeur n’est pas éclairci et les enregistrements d’écran peuvent montrer la superposition."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Posvjetljuje pomoću prekrivnog sloja. Pokazivač se ne posvjetljuje, a prekrivni sloj može biti vidljiv na snimkama zaslona."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aumenta la luminosità tramite una sovrapposizione. Il puntatore non diventa più luminoso e le registrazioni dello schermo potrebbero mostrare la sovrapposizione."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gjør lysere med et overlegg. Pekeren blir ikke lysere, og skjermopptak kan vise overlegget."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maakt helderder via een laag over het scherm. De aanwijzer wordt niet helderder en schermopnamen kunnen die laag tonen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rozjaśnia za pomocą nakładki. Wskaźnik nie jest rozjaśniany, a nakładka może być widoczna na nagraniach ekranu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aumenta o brilho por meio de uma sobreposição. O ponteiro não fica mais claro, e gravações de tela podem mostrar a sobreposição."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aumenta o brilho através de uma sobreposição. O cursor não fica mais brilhante e as gravações de ecrã podem mostrar a sobreposição."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mărește luminozitatea printr‑un strat suprapus. Cursorul nu devine mai luminos, iar înregistrările ecranului pot arăta stratul suprapus."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Повышает яркость с помощью наложения. Указатель не становится ярче, а наложение может быть видно в записях экрана."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zjasňuje pomocou prekryvnej vrstvy. Ukazovateľ sa nezjasní a na záznamoch obrazovky môže byť prekryvná vrstva viditeľná."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Posvetli s prekrivnim slojem. Kazalec se ne posvetli, na posnetkih zaslona pa je prekrivni sloj lahko viden."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gör skärmen ljusare med ett överlägg. Pekaren blir inte ljusare och skärminspelningar kan visa överlägget."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Підвищує яскравість за допомогою накладання. Курсор не стає яскравішим, а накладання може бути видно на записах екрана."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Brightens through an overlay. The pointer isn’t brightened, and screen recordings may show the overlay."
          }
        }
      }
