    "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar." : {
      "comment" : "Help: answer about a hidden menu bar icon",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si la barra de menús és plena o el macOS n’amaga la icona, obre l’Overbright des del Finder o l’Spotlight per veure la configuració. A la secció Barra de menús de la configuració del sistema, comprova que l’Overbright estigui activat a “Permet a la barra de menús”."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pokud je řádek nabídek plný nebo macOS ikonu skrývá, otevřete Overbright z Finderu nebo pomocí Spotlightu a zobrazí se Nastavení. V nastavení Řádek nabídek zkontrolujte, že je Overbright zapnutý v seznamu Povolit v řádku nabídek."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvis menulinjen er fuld, eller macOS skjuler symbolet, kan du åbne Overbright fra Finder eller Spotlight for at se indstillingerne. Tjek i indstillingerne til Menulinje, at Overbright er slået til under “Tillad på menulinjen”."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn die Menüleiste voll ist oder macOS das Symbol ausblendet, öffne Overbright über den Finder oder Spotlight, um die Einstellungen zu sehen. Prüfe in den Systemeinstellungen unter „Menüleiste“, ob Overbright bei „In Menüleiste erlauben“ aktiviert ist."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si la barra de menús está llena o macOS oculta el icono, abre Overbright desde el Finder o Spotlight para ver los ajustes. En los ajustes de “Barra de menús”, comprueba que Overbright esté activado en “Permitir en la barra de menús”."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si la barre des menus est pleine ou si macOS masque l’icône, ouvrez Overbright depuis le Finder ou Spotlight pour afficher les réglages. Dans les réglages Barre des menus, vérifiez qu’Overbright est activé sous « Autoriser dans la barre des menus »."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ako je traka s izbornicima puna ili macOS skriva ikonu, otvorite Overbright iz Findera ili Spotlighta da biste vidjeli postavke. U odjeljku Traka s izbornicima u Postavkama sustava provjerite je li Overbright uključen pod “Dozvoli u traci s izbornicima”."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se la barra dei menu è piena o macOS nasconde l’icona, apri Overbright dal Finder o da Spotlight per vedere le impostazioni. Nelle impostazioni “Barra dei menu”, verifica che Overbright sia attivo in “Consenti nella barra dei menu”."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvis menylinjen er full eller macOS skjuler symbolet, åpner du Overbright fra Finder eller Spotlight for å se Innstillinger. I Menylinje-innstillingene kontrollerer du at Overbright er slått på under «Tillat i menylinjen»."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als de menubalk vol is of macOS het symbool verbergt, open je Overbright vanuit de Finder of Spotlight om de instellingen te zien. Controleer in de instellingen voor ‘Menubalk’ of Overbright is ingeschakeld bij ‘Sta toe in de menubalk’."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeśli pasek menu jest zapełniony lub macOS ukrywa ikonę, otwórz Overbright z Findera lub ze Spotlight, aby zobaczyć ustawienia. W ustawieniach „Pasek menu” sprawdź, czy Overbright jest włączony na liście „Pozwalaj na pasku menu”."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se a barra de menus estiver cheia ou o macOS ocultar o ícone, abra o Overbright pelo Finder ou pelo Spotlight para ver os ajustes. Nos ajustes de Barra de Menus, verifique se o Overbright está ativado em Permitir na Barra de Menus."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se a barra de menus estiver cheia ou o macOS ocultar o ícone, abra o Overbright a partir do Finder ou do Spotlight para ver as Definições. Nas definições da Barra de menus, confirme que o Overbright está ativado em “Permitir na barra de menus”."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dacă bara de meniu este plină sau macOS ascunde pictograma, deschideți Overbright din Finder sau Spotlight pentru a vedea configurările. În secțiunea Bară de meniu din Configurări sistem, verificați dacă Overbright este activat la „Permiteți în bara de meniu”."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Если строка меню заполнена или macOS скрывает значок, откройте Overbright из Finder или Spotlight, чтобы попасть в настройки. В разделе «Строка меню» Системных настроек проверьте, что Overbright включён в списке «Разрешить в строке меню»."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ak je lišta plná alebo macOS ikonu skrýva, otvorte Overbright z Findera alebo zo Spotlightu a zobrazia sa Nastavenia. V nastaveniach Lišta skontrolujte, či je Overbright zapnuté v časti Povoliť položky v lište."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Če je menijska vrstica polna ali macOS skrije ikono, odprite Overbright iz Finderja ali Spotlighta, da vidite nastavitve. V nastavitvah Menijska vrstica preverite, ali je Overbright vklopljen pod »Dovoljeno v menijski vrstici«."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Om menyraden är full eller om macOS döljer symbolen öppnar du Overbright från Finder eller Spotlight för att se inställningarna. Kontrollera i inställningarna för Menyrad att Overbright är påslagen under ”Tillåt i menyraden”."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Якщо смуга меню заповнена або macOS приховує значок, відкрийте Overbright із Finder чи Spotlight, щоб перейти до параметрів. У розділі «Смуга меню» Системних параметрів перевірте, що Overbright увімкнено у списку «Дозволити на смузі меню»."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        }
      }
