    "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control." : {
      "comment" : "Help: the Run Shortcut recipe",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per posar l’Overbright al Centre de control o a la barra de menús, crea una drecera amb “Activa o desactiva l’Overbright” i després afegeix el control “Executa una drecera” del Centre de control."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chcete‑li mít Overbright v Ovládacím centru nebo na řádku nabídek, vytvořte zkratku s akcí „Zapnout nebo vypnout Overbright“ a pak do Ovládacího centra přidejte ovládací prvek Spustit zkratku."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvis du vil have Overbright i Kontrolcenter eller på menulinjen, skal du oprette en genvej med “Slå Overbright til eller fra” og derefter tilføje betjeningsmuligheden “Start genvej” i Kontrolcenter."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Um Overbright ins Kontrollzentrum oder in die Menüleiste zu bringen, erstelle einen Kurzbefehl mit „Overbright ein- oder ausschalten“ und füge dann im Kontrollzentrum das Steuerelement „Kurzbefehl ausführen“ hinzu."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para poner Overbright en el centro de control o en la barra de menús, crea un atajo con “Activar o desactivar Overbright” y, luego, añade el control “Ejecutar atajo” del centro de control."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pour placer Overbright dans le Centre de contrôle ou la barre des menus, créez un raccourci avec « Activer ou désactiver Overbright », puis ajoutez la commande « Exécuter le raccourci » au Centre de contrôle."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Da biste Overbright stavili u Kontrolni centar ili traku s izbornicima, izradite prečac s radnjom “Uključi ili isključi Overbright”, a zatim u Kontrolni centar dodajte kontrolu “Pokreni prečac”."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per aggiungere Overbright a Centro di Controllo o alla barra dei menu, crea un comando rapido con “Attiva o disattiva Overbright”, quindi aggiungi il controllo “Esegui comando rapido” di Centro di Controllo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For å legge Overbright i Kontrollsenter eller menylinjen lager du en snarvei med «Slå Overbright på eller av» og legger så til Kontrollsenter-kontrollen «Utfør snarvei»."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Om Overbright in het Bedieningspaneel of de menubalk te zetten, maak je een opdracht met ‘Schakel Overbright in of uit’ en voeg je daarna de regelaar ‘Voer opdracht uit’ toe aan het Bedieningspaneel."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aby dodać Overbright do Centrum sterowania lub paska menu, utwórz skrót z czynnością „Włącz lub wyłącz Overbright”, a następnie dodaj w Centrum sterowania element „Uruchom skrót”."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para colocar o Overbright na Central de Controle ou na barra de menus, crie um atalho com “Ativar ou Desativar Overbright” e depois adicione o controle “Executar Atalho” da Central de Controle."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para colocar o Overbright na Central de controlo ou na barra de menus, crie um atalho com a ação “Ativar ou desativar o Overbright” e, depois, adicione o controlo “Executar atalho” da Central de controlo."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pentru a pune Overbright în Centrul de control sau în bara de meniu, creați o scurtătură cu acțiunea „Activați sau dezactivați Overbright”, apoi adăugați în Centrul de control comanda „Rulați scurtătura”."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Чтобы добавить Overbright в Пункт управления или строку меню, создайте быструю команду с действием «Включить или выключить Overbright», а затем добавьте в Пункт управления элемент «Запустить быструю команду»."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ak chcete mať Overbright v Ovládacom centre alebo v lište, vytvorte skratku s akciou „Zapnúť alebo vypnúť Overbright“ a potom do Ovládacieho centra pridajte ovládací prvok Spustiť skratku."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Če želite Overbright dodati v Nadzorno središče ali menijsko vrstico, ustvarite bližnjico z dejanjem »Vklopi ali izklopi Overbright«, nato pa v Nadzorno središče dodajte krmilno funkcijo »Zaženi bližnjico«."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Om du vill lägga Overbright i Kontrollcenter eller menyraden skapar du en genväg med ”Slå på eller stäng av Overbright” och lägger sedan till reglaget ”Kör genväg” i Kontrollcenter."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Щоб додати Overbright до Центру керування або на смугу меню, створіть швидку команду з дією «Увімкнути або вимкнути Overbright», а потім додайте до Центру керування елемент «Запустити швидку команду»."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "To put Overbright in Control Center or the menu bar, make a shortcut with Turn Overbright On or Off, then add Control Center’s Run Shortcut control."
          }
        }
      }
    },
