    "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports." : {
      "comment" : "Help: answer to “The screen didn’t get brighter”",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apuja del tot la brillantor de la pantalla; l’Overbright hi afegeix llum. Consulta la valoració de la pantalla a Configuració ▸ Pantalles. En un MacBook Pro, fes servir la preconfiguració de 1600 nits. En alguns Mac, el macOS ignora els canvis a la taula de colors: tria “Calibra…” per comprovar‑ho o prova el mode de compatibilitat. “Executa l’autoprova…” mostra què indica el macOS."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nastavte jas monitoru na maximum; Overbright přidá světlo navíc. Stav monitoru zkontrolujte v Nastavení ▸ Monitory. Na MacBooku Pro použijte předvolbu 1600 nitů. Na některých Macích macOS ignoruje změny tabulky barev: ověřte to volbou Kalibrovat… nebo zkuste režim kompatibility. Volba Spustit autotest… ukáže, co hlásí macOS."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skru helt op for skærmens lysstyrke – Overbright lægger lys oven i. Tjek skærmens status under Indstillinger ▸ Skærme. På en MacBook Pro skal du bruge forindstillingen med 1600 nits. På nogle Mac-computere ignorerer macOS ændringer i farvetabellen: Vælg Kalibrer… for at tjekke det, eller prøv kompatibilitetstilstand. Kør selvtest… viser, hvad macOS rapporterer."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stelle die Displayhelligkeit ganz hoch; Overbright erhöht sie zusätzlich. Prüfe die Bewertung des Displays unter Einstellungen ▸ Displays. Verwende auf einem MacBook Pro die Voreinstellung mit 1600 Nits. Auf manchen Macs ignoriert macOS Änderungen der Farbtabelle: Wähle „Kalibrieren …“, um das zu prüfen, oder probiere den Kompatibilitätsmodus. „Selbsttest ausführen …“ zeigt, was macOS meldet."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sube el brillo de la pantalla del todo; Overbright se suma a él. Consulta el estado de la pantalla en Ajustes ▸ Pantallas. En un MacBook Pro, usa el preajuste de 1600 nits. En algunos Mac, macOS ignora los cambios en la tabla de colores: elige “Calibrar…” para comprobarlo o prueba el modo de compatibilidad. “Ejecutar autoprueba…” muestra lo que informa macOS."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Montez la luminosité de l’écran au maximum ; Overbright s’y ajoute. Consultez l’évaluation de l’écran dans Réglages ▸ Écrans. Sur un MacBook Pro, utilisez le préréglage à 1600 nits. Sur certains Mac, macOS ignore les modifications de la table des couleurs : choisissez « Calibrer… » pour le vérifier, ou essayez le mode de compatibilité. « Lancer l’autotest… » montre ce que signale macOS."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Povećajte svjetlinu zaslona do kraja; Overbright dodaje svjetlo povrh nje. Provjerite status zaslona u odjeljku Postavke ▸ Zasloni. Na MacBook Pro računalu koristite podešenje od 1600 nita. Na nekim Mac računalima macOS zanemaruje promjene tablice boja: odaberite “Kalibriraj…” da biste to provjerili ili isprobajte način kompatibilnosti. “Pokreni samoprovjeru…” prikazuje što macOS javlja."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Porta la luminosità dello schermo al massimo; Overbright si aggiunge a essa. Controlla lo stato dello schermo in Impostazioni ▸ Schermi. Su un MacBook Pro, usa il preset da 1600 nit. Su alcuni Mac, macOS ignora le modifiche alla tabella colori: scegli “Calibra…” per verificarlo, oppure prova la modalità compatibilità. “Esegui autotest…” mostra cosa riporta macOS."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skru lysstyrken på skjermen helt opp – Overbright legger til mer. Sjekk skjermens vurdering i Innstillinger ▸ Skjermer. På en MacBook Pro bruker du forhåndsinnstillingen med 1600 nit. På noen Macer ignorerer macOS endringer i fargetabellen: velg «Kalibrer…» for å sjekke, eller prøv kompatibilitetsmodus. «Kjør selvtest…» viser hva macOS rapporterer."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zet de helderheid van het beeldscherm helemaal omhoog; Overbright voegt daar licht aan toe. Bekijk de beoordeling van het beeldscherm in Instellingen ▸ Beeldschermen. Gebruik op een MacBook Pro de voorinstelling van 1600 nits. Op sommige Macs negeert macOS wijzigingen in de kleurentabel: kies ‘Kalibreer…’ om dit te controleren, of probeer de compatibiliteitsmodus. ‘Voer zelftest uit…’ laat zien wat macOS rapporteert."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ustaw maksymalną jasność wyświetlacza; Overbright dodaje światło ponad nią. Sprawdź ocenę wyświetlacza w sekcji Ustawienia ▸ Wyświetlacze. Na MacBooku Pro użyj ustawienia wstępnego 1600 nt. Na niektórych Macach macOS ignoruje zmiany tabeli kolorów: wybierz „Skalibruj…”, aby to sprawdzić, lub spróbuj trybu zgodności. „Uruchom autotest…” pokaże, co zgłasza macOS."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aumente o brilho da tela até o fim; o Overbright acrescenta luz a ele. Confira o status da tela em Ajustes ▸ Telas. Em um MacBook Pro, use o pré-ajuste de 1600 nits. Em alguns Macs, o macOS ignora alterações na tabela de cores: escolha “Calibrar…” para verificar ou experimente o Modo de Compatibilidade. “Executar Autoteste…” mostra o que o macOS informa."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ponha o brilho do monitor no máximo; o Overbright acrescenta luz a esse brilho. Verifique o diagnóstico do monitor em Definições ▸ Monitores. Num MacBook Pro, use a predefinição de 1600 nits. Em alguns Mac, o macOS ignora as alterações à tabela de cores: escolha “Calibrar…” para verificar ou experimente o modo de compatibilidade. “Executar autoteste…” mostra o que o macOS indica."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setați luminozitatea afișajului la maximum; Overbright adaugă peste ea. Verificați starea afișajului în Configurări ▸ Afișaje. Pe un MacBook Pro, folosiți preconfigurarea de 1600 de niți. Pe unele Mac‑uri, macOS ignoră modificările tabelului de culori: alegeți „Calibrați…” pentru a verifica sau încercați modul de compatibilitate. „Rulați autotestul…” arată ce raportează macOS."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Поднимите яркость дисплея до максимума: Overbright добавляет свет поверх неё. Проверьте статус дисплея в разделе Настройки ▸ Дисплеи. На MacBook Pro выберите набор настроек на 1600 нит. На некоторых Mac macOS игнорирует изменения цветовой таблицы: чтобы проверить это, выберите «Откалибровать…» или попробуйте режим совместимости. «Запустить самопроверку…» покажет, что сообщает macOS."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nastavte jas displeja na maximum; Overbright pridáva navyše. Stav displeja skontrolujte v Nastaveniach ▸ Displeje. Na MacBooku Pro použite predvoľbu 1600 nitov. Na niektorých Macoch macOS ignoruje zmeny tabuľky farieb: overte to pomocou voľby Kalibrovať… alebo skúste režim kompatibility. Voľba Spustiť autotest… ukáže, čo hlási macOS."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nastavite najvišjo svetlost zaslona; Overbright doda še več. Stanje zaslona preverite v Nastavitvah ▸ Zasloni. Na MacBooku Pro uporabite prednastavitev 1600 nitov. Na nekaterih Macih macOS prezre spremembe barvne tabele: to preverite z možnostjo »Umeri …« ali preskusite način združljivosti. »Zaženi samopreizkus …« pokaže, kaj sporoča macOS."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Höj skärmens ljusstyrka hela vägen – Overbright lägger till ljus ovanpå. Kontrollera skärmens status i Inställningar ▸ Skärmar. På en MacBook Pro använder du förinställningen för 1600 cd/㎡. På vissa Mac-datorer ignorerar macOS ändringar i färgtabellen – välj Kalibrera… för att kontrollera, eller prova kompatibilitetsläge. Kör självtest… visar vad macOS rapporterar."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Підніміть яскравість дисплея до максимуму: Overbright додає світло поверх неї. Перевірте статус дисплея в розділі Параметри ▸ Дисплеї. На MacBook Pro виберіть набір параметрів на 1600 ніт. На деяких Mac macOS ігнорує зміни колірної таблиці: щоб перевірити це, виберіть «Відкалібрувати…» або спробуйте режим сумісності. «Запустити самоперевірку…» покаже, що повідомляє macOS."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
