    "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness." : {
      "comment" : "Help: answer about the brightness keys",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Amb l’opció “Afegeix brillantor extra només a prop de la brillantor màxima” activada, l’Overbright només afegeix llum quan la pantalla és a prop de la brillantor màxima, de manera que les tecles de brillantor mantenen el seu interval normal. Desactiva‑la a Configuració ▸ Pantalles per multiplicar qualsevol brillantor."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Když je zapnutá volba Přidávat extra jas jen při téměř plném jasu, Overbright přidává světlo jen tehdy, když je jas monitoru téměř plný, takže klávesy jasu si zachovají běžný rozsah. Chcete‑li násobit jakýkoli jas, vypněte ji v Nastavení ▸ Monitory."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når “Tilføj kun ekstra lysstyrke nær fuld lysstyrke” er slået til, tilføjer Overbright kun lys, når skærmen er tæt på fuld lysstyrke, så lysstyrketasterne beholder deres normale område. Slå indstillingen fra under Indstillinger ▸ Skærme for at forstærke enhver lysstyrke."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn „Zusatzhelligkeit nur nahe voller Helligkeit hinzufügen“ aktiv ist, fügt Overbright nur Licht hinzu, wenn das Display nahe voller Helligkeit ist, sodass die Helligkeitstasten ihren normalen Bereich behalten. Deaktiviere die Option unter Einstellungen ▸ Displays, um jede Helligkeit zu verstärken."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con “Añadir brillo extra solo cerca del brillo máximo” activado, Overbright solo añade luz cuando la pantalla está cerca del brillo máximo, así que las teclas de brillo mantienen su rango normal. Desactívalo en Ajustes ▸ Pantallas para multiplicar cualquier brillo."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lorsque « N’ajouter de la luminosité supplémentaire que près du maximum » est activé, Overbright n’ajoute de la lumière que si l’écran est proche de sa luminosité maximale, ce qui préserve la plage normale des touches de luminosité. Désactivez cette option dans Réglages ▸ Écrans pour multiplier n’importe quelle luminosité."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kad je uključeno “Dodatna svjetlina samo blizu pune svjetline”, Overbright dodaje svjetlo samo kad je zaslon blizu pune svjetline, pa tipke za svjetlinu zadržavaju uobičajeni raspon. Isključite to u odjeljku Postavke ▸ Zasloni da biste pojačali bilo koju svjetlinu."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con “Aggiungi luminosità extra solo vicino alla luminosità massima” attivo, Overbright aggiunge luce solo quando lo schermo è vicino alla luminosità massima, così i tasti della luminosità mantengono il loro intervallo normale. Disattivalo in Impostazioni ▸ Schermi per moltiplicare qualsiasi luminosità."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Med «Legg til ekstra lysstyrke bare nær full lysstyrke» på legger Overbright bare til lys når skjermen er nær full lysstyrke, så lysstyrketastene beholder sitt vanlige område. Slå den av i Innstillinger ▸ Skjermer for å forsterke lysstyrken på alle nivåer."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als ‘Voeg alleen extra helderheid toe bij bijna volle helderheid’ is ingeschakeld, voegt Overbright alleen licht toe als het beeldscherm bijna op volle helderheid staat, zodat de helderheidstoetsen hun normale bereik houden. Schakel dit uit in Instellingen ▸ Beeldschermen om elke helderheid te vermenigvuldigen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gdy włączone jest ustawienie „Dodawaj dodatkową jasność tylko blisko pełnej jasności”, Overbright dodaje światło tylko wtedy, gdy jasność wyświetlacza jest bliska pełnej, więc klawisze jasności działają w zwykłym zakresie. Wyłącz je w sekcji Ustawienia ▸ Wyświetlacze, aby wzmacniać każdą jasność."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Com “Adicionar brilho extra só perto do brilho máximo” ativado, o Overbright só adiciona luz quando a tela está perto do brilho máximo, então as teclas de brilho mantêm a faixa normal. Desative a opção em Ajustes ▸ Telas para multiplicar qualquer brilho."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Com “Adicionar brilho extra só perto do brilho máximo” ativado, o Overbright só acrescenta luz quando o monitor está perto do brilho máximo, por isso as teclas de brilho mantêm o intervalo normal. Desative esta opção em Definições ▸ Monitores para multiplicar qualquer nível de brilho."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cu „Luminozitate suplimentară doar aproape de maxim” activată, Overbright adaugă lumină doar când afișajul este aproape de luminozitatea maximă, astfel încât tastele de luminozitate își păstrează intervalul normal. Dezactivați opțiunea în Configurări ▸ Afișaje pentru a amplifica orice luminozitate."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Когда включена настройка «Добавлять дополнительную яркость только вблизи максимума», Overbright добавляет свет, только если яркость дисплея близка к максимальной, поэтому клавиши яркости работают в обычном диапазоне. Чтобы усиливать любую яркость, выключите эту настройку в разделе Настройки ▸ Дисплеи."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keď je zapnutá funkcia Pridávať extra jas len pri takmer plnom jase, Overbright pridáva svetlo len vtedy, keď je jas displeja takmer plný, takže klávesy jasu si zachovajú bežný rozsah. Ak chcete násobiť akýkoľvek jas, vypnite ju v Nastaveniach ▸ Displeje."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ko je vklopljena možnost »Dodatno svetlost dodaj le pri skoraj polni svetlosti«, Overbright doda svetlobo le, ko je svetlost zaslona skoraj polna, zato tipke za svetlost ohranijo običajni razpon. Če želite pomnožiti katero koli svetlost, jo izklopite v Nastavitvah ▸ Zasloni."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "När ”Lägg bara till extra ljusstyrka nära full ljusstyrka” är på lägger Overbright bara till ljus när skärmen är nära full ljusstyrka, så att ljusstyrketangenterna behåller sitt vanliga omfång. Stäng av inställningen i Inställningar ▸ Skärmar för att förstärka all ljusstyrka."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Коли ввімкнено параметр «Додавати додаткову яскравість лише поблизу максимуму», Overbright додає світло, лише якщо яскравість дисплея близька до максимальної, тож клавіші яскравості працюють у звичайному діапазоні. Щоб підсилювати будь-яку яскравість, вимкніть цей параметр у розділі Параметри ▸ Дисплеї."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes. More light takes more power, roughly in proportion. By default Overbright pauses below %@ battery and in Low Power Mode." : {
      "comment" : "Help: answer about battery use; the placeholder is the default battery level, e.g. “20%”",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Yes. More light takes more power, roughly in proportion. By default Overbright pauses below %@ battery and in Low Power Mode."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sí. Més llum consumeix més energia, aproximadament en proporció. Per omissió, l’Overbright es posa en pausa quan la bateria és per sota del %@ i en mode de baix consum."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ano. Víc světla spotřebuje víc energie, zhruba úměrně. Ve výchozím nastavení se Overbright pozastaví při nabití baterie pod %@ a v režimu nízké spotřeby."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ja. Mere lys kræver mere strøm, omtrent proportionalt. Som standard holder Overbright pause, når batteriet er under %@, og når Energibesparende funktion er slået til."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ja. Mehr Licht braucht mehr Energie, ungefähr proportional. Standardmäßig pausiert Overbright bei einem Ladestand unter %@ und im Stromsparmodus."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Yes. More light takes more power, roughly in proportion. By default Overbright pauses below %@ battery and in Low Power Mode."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sí. Más luz consume más energía, de forma más o menos proporcional. De forma predeterminada, Overbright se pausa con la batería por debajo del %@ y en el modo de bajo consumo."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Yes. More light takes more power, roughly in proportion. By default Overbright pauses below %@ battery and in Low Power Mode."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oui. Plus de lumière demande plus d’énergie, à peu près proportionnellement. Par défaut, Overbright se met en pause sous %@ de batterie et en mode Économie d’énergie."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Yes. More light takes more power, roughly in proportion. By default Overbright pauses below %@ battery and in Low Power Mode."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Yes. More light takes more power, roughly in proportion. By default Overbright pauses below %@ battery and in Low Power Mode."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Da. Više svjetla troši više energije, otprilike razmjerno. Prema standardnim postavkama Overbright se pauzira kad je baterija ispod %@ i kad je uključen Mod slabog napajanja."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Yes. More light takes more power, roughly in proportion. By default Overbright pauses below %@ battery and in Low Power Mode."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Yes. More light takes more power, roughly in proportion. By default Overbright pauses below %@ battery and in Low Power Mode."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sì. Più luce richiede più energia, più o meno in proporzione. Per impostazione predefinita, Overbright va in pausa con la batteria sotto il %@ e in modalità “Risparmio energetico”."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Yes. More light takes more power, roughly in proportion. By default Overbright pauses below %@ battery and in Low Power Mode."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Yes. More light takes more power, roughly in proportion. By default Overbright pauses below %@ battery and in Low Power Mode."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Yes. More light takes more power, roughly in proportion. By default Overbright pauses below %@ battery and in Low Power Mode."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ja. Mer lys krever mer strøm, omtrent i samme forhold. Som standard settes Overbright på pause når batteriet er under %@, og i Spareblussmodus."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ja. Meer licht kost meer energie, ongeveer naar verhouding. In de standaardinstellingen pauzeert Overbright als de batterij onder %@ komt en in de energiebesparingsmodus."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tak. Więcej światła wymaga więcej energii, mniej więcej proporcjonalnie. Domyślnie Overbright wstrzymuje się, gdy poziom baterii spadnie poniżej %@, oraz w trybie Niskie zużycie energii."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sim. Mais luz consome mais energia, mais ou menos na mesma proporção. Por padrão, o Overbright pausa com a bateria abaixo de %@ e no Modo Pouca Energia."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sim. Mais luz gasta mais energia, de forma aproximadamente proporcional. Por predefinição, o Overbright entra em pausa com a bateria abaixo de %@ e no modo de baixo consumo."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Da. Mai multă lumină consumă mai multă energie, aproximativ proporțional. Implicit, Overbright se pune pe pauză când bateria scade sub %@ și în modul Consum redus."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Да. Больше света — больше расход энергии, примерно пропорционально. По умолчанию Overbright приостанавливается при заряде ниже %@ и в режиме энергосбережения."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Áno. Viac svetla spotrebuje viac energie, približne úmerne. V predvolenom nastavení sa Overbright pozastaví pri nabití batérie pod %@ a v režime nízkej spotreby."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Da. Več svetlobe porabi več energije, približno sorazmerno. Overbright se privzeto začasno ustavi, ko je raven baterije pod %@, in v načinu nizke porabe."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ja. Mer ljus drar mer ström, ungefär proportionellt. Som standard pausar Overbright när batterinivån är under %@ och när strömsparläget är på."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Yes. More light takes more power, roughly in proportion. By default Overbright pauses below %@ battery and in Low Power Mode."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Yes. More light takes more power, roughly in proportion. By default Overbright pauses below %@ battery and in Low Power Mode."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Так. Більше світла — більша витрата енергії, приблизно пропорційно. Типово Overbright призупиняється, коли заряд нижче %@, і в режимі економії заряду."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
